text = "-> Being a gay knight is forbidden
-> Having an OF is mandatory
-> Math problems must result in a chocolate bar with neon green sugar and butter
-> Dividing is like snacking. But blindfolded, with brittle bone disease
-> If it’s wrong, it’s not right. And you shouldn’t do it
-> Unless we’re talking about neon green buttered sugar
-> Diego T-poses, I Tree-pose, and Julius Caesar Jul-poses
-> This artifact is sponsored by Raid Shadow Legend!"
