text = "71 is a non-allergenic no, 8 is a real apple pie.
But how do you make this dish of water and oil without serving the dogs a bottle of gasoline?

In the case of 62 + 22, you see 3
In the case of 96 - 41, we just see 0
And in 23 * 45, we see 2"
