custom_minimum_size = Vector2(1, 0)
layout_mode = 2
text = "“An angel at 134.9 degrees southwest dancing the water dance on the Titanic will live longer than a sea lion on a skateboard,” said an old Chinese master when speaking of order in society.
These words are more valuable than when Mickey brings his house back up from the Underworld.

And according to Bruce Lee, the order mentioned here is MATHEMATICAL!!!! He told the Terminator about this MATHEMATICAL order!!!!
Here it is:
(___) < * < +, -"
